  "id": "great-ball-league",
  "name": "Great Ball League",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "Great Ball League tournaments, part of the Pokémon Asia Championship Series, are held in Malaysia, Singapore and the Philippines, and in 2025-26 also in Taiwan, Hong Kong, Thailand and Indonesia. Players got a copy of a recent Trainer card with the Great Ball League logo: Paradox Rift's Earthen Vessel, Shrouded Fable's Night Stretcher and Surging Sparks' Tera Orb, then cosmos holo Air Balloon, Mega Signal and Tool Scrapper for the first, second and third seasons of 2025-26. The top players won a holo Pidgeot ex in 2024-25, and a holo Reshiram ex across the first three seasons of 2025-26.",
